(3). Classify 5 examples as rule-based, ML, or generative AI
Traffic light system — Rule-based, because it follows predefined instructions.
Email spam filter — ML, because it learns patterns to identify spam emails.
YouTube recommendations — ML, because it suggests videos based on user interests.
ChatGPT — Generative AI, because it generates answers from prompts.
AI image generator — Generative AI, because it creates images from text descriptions.
